# The first turn, loaded from the game's autosave: the map with the tutorial
# note, the map, the lab summary (F2), the game menu and the quit dialog. Leave time after each
# step: the map scrolls smoothly to the active unit, and a key that arrives
# mid-scroll leaves the view elsewhere.
25 load
42 snap note
48 click 362 734         # the note's Close
49 snap map
52 key F2
56 snap lab
59 click 636 520         # the lab summary's Close
63 snap map-again
66 click 63 538          # MENU
70 snap menu
73 key Escape            # closes the menu, then asks to quit
77 snap quit-dialog
80 close
